<article class="env-corollary" id="02NL">
<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02NL">Corollary <span data-tag="02NL">7.2.1.20</span>.</a> Let $f: X \rightarrow Y$ and $f': X' \rightarrow Y'$ be left cofinal morphisms of simplicial sets. Then the product map $(f \times f'): X \times X' \rightarrow Y \times Y'$ is left cofinal. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
<p>
<strong>Proof.</strong>
      Factoring $f \times f'$ as a composition 
    <p>
<div class="equation">
  \[  X \times X' \xrightarrow { f \times \operatorname{id}_{X'} } Y \times X' \xrightarrow { \operatorname{id}_{Y} \times f'} Y \times Y', \]
</div>
<p>
       the desired result follows by combining Corollary <a data-tag="02NK" href="/tag/02NK">7.2.1.19</a> with Proposition <a data-tag="02N6" href="/tag/02N6">7.2.1.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
</p>
</p></p></article>
